# Taplink SDK – Error Handling

---

## Error Classes

### `PaymentError` — Transaction errors

```kotlin
error.code                    // String error code, e.g., "306"
error.message                 // Human-readable description
error.suggestion              // Recommended action
error.category                // ErrorCategory enum
error.canRetryWithSameId      // Boolean: safe to retry with same transactionRequestId?
error.traceId                 // For troubleshooting with SUNBAY support
error.referenceOrderId        // Merchant order ID from request
error.transactionId           // Platform transaction ID (if assigned)
error.transactionRequestId    // Transaction request ID from request
```

### `ConnectionError` — Connection errors

```kotlin
error.code     // Error code string
error.message  // Description
```

---

## Error Categories (`ErrorCategory`)

```kotlin
when (error.category) {
    ErrorCategory.INITIALIZATION -> {
        // SDK not initialized or service issue
        // Action: re-call TaplinkSDK.init() or restart app
    }
    ErrorCategory.CONNECTION -> {
        // Connection failed or lost
        // Action: check mode-specific requirements and call TaplinkSDK.connect()
    }
    ErrorCategory.AUTHENTICATION -> {
        // Invalid appId, merchantId, or secretKey
        // Action: verify TaplinkConfig credentials
    }
    ErrorCategory.TRANSACTION -> {
        // Transaction rejected or processing error
        // Action: check error.canRetryWithSameId and error.suggestion
    }
}
```

---

## Error Code Reference

> Error code `100` = **success** (not an error). Actual errors start at `200`.

### Initialization Errors (20x)

| Code | Issue | Action |
|------|-------|--------|
| 201 | SDK not initialized | Call `TaplinkSDK.init()` before any operation |
| 202 | SDK service error | Restart the application |
| 203 | Tapro initialization failed | Disconnect and reconnect |

### Connection State Errors (21x)

| Code | Issue | Action |
|------|-------|--------|
| 211 | Already connecting | Wait for current connect to complete |
| 212 | Already connected | No action needed, already connected |
| 213 | Not connected | Call `TaplinkSDK.connect()` first |
| 214 | Connection failed | Check device, network, and credentials |
| 221 | Auth/handshake failed | Verify appId, merchantId, secretKey |

### App-to-App Mode Errors (23x)

| Code | Issue | Action |
|------|-------|--------|
| 231 | Tapro app not installed | Ask user to install Tapro app |
| 232 | Tapro app not running | Restart device or relaunch Tapro |

### LAN Mode Errors (24x)

| Code | Issue | Action |
|------|-------|--------|
| 241 | Cannot reach terminal IP | Check IP address and network connectivity |
| 242 | Network unavailable | Check Wi-Fi or wired connection |

### Cable Mode Errors (25x)

| Code | Issue | Action |
|------|-------|--------|
| 251 | No USB device found | Check cable connection |
| 252 | USB permission denied | Handle Android USB permission dialog |
| 253 | Protocol mismatch | Try `CableProtocol.AUTO` |
| 254 | Cable communication error | Re-plug cable and reconnect |
| 255 | Serial port open failed | Check USB driver compatibility |

### Transaction Errors (30x)

| Code | Issue | Action | Retry Rule |
|------|-------|--------|------------|
| 301 | Invalid parameters | Fix request parameters | ✅ Same ID |
| 302 | Request send failed | Check connection and retry | ✅ Same ID |
| 303 | Request serialization error | Check request object | ✅ Same ID |
| 304 | Transaction in progress | Wait for current transaction | ✅ Same ID |
| 305 | Network error during send | Retry after reconnecting | ✅ Same ID |
| 306 | **Response timeout** | **Query status first**, then decide | ⚠️ Query first |
| 307 | Transaction rejected | Check error message, use new ID | ❌ New ID |
| 308 | Duplicate transaction ID | Use new `transactionRequestId` | ❌ New ID |
| 309 | Transaction failed | Review details | ❌ New ID |
| 310 | Invalid response | Contact SUNBAY support | ❌ New ID |
| 311 | Transaction cancelled | User or system cancelled | ❌ New ID |

---

## Retry Rules

```
✅ Same ID OK  → error.canRetryWithSameId == true  → Retry with same transactionRequestId
⚠️ Query first → error.code == "306"              → MUST query status before any retry
❌ New ID      → error.canRetryWithSameId == false  → MUST use a new transactionRequestId
```

---

## Error 306 Timeout Handling Pattern

When `error.code == "306"`, the transaction **may or may not** have been processed.  
Always query status first before retrying:

```kotlin
override fun onFailure(error: PaymentError) {
    if (error.code == "306") {
        // MUST query before retrying
        queryWithPolling(error.transactionRequestId!!)
    } else if (error.canRetryWithSameId) {
        // Safe to retry with same ID
        retryTransaction(originalRequest)
    } else {
        // Must create new transaction with new transactionRequestId
        val newRequest = originalRequest.copy(
            transactionRequestId = "TXN_${System.currentTimeMillis()}"
        )
        client.sale(newRequest, callback)
    }
}

private fun queryWithPolling(txnRequestId: String, attempt: Int = 1) {
    if (attempt > 12) {  // Max 12 attempts = 60 seconds
        showError("Status unknown. Contact support. ID: $txnRequestId")
        return
    }

    val query = QueryRequest().setTransactionRequestId(txnRequestId)
    client.query(query, object : PaymentCallback {
        override fun onSuccess(result: PaymentResult) {
            when (result.transactionStatus) {
                "SUCCESS"    -> handleSuccess(result)
                "FAILED"     -> handleFailure(result)
                "PROCESSING" -> {
                    // Continue polling after 5 seconds
                    Handler(Looper.getMainLooper()).postDelayed({
                        queryWithPolling(txnRequestId, attempt + 1)
                    }, 5000)
                }
            }
        }
        override fun onFailure(error: PaymentError) {
            // Query itself failed — retry polling
            Handler(Looper.getMainLooper()).postDelayed({
                queryWithPolling(txnRequestId, attempt + 1)
            }, 5000)
        }
        override fun onProgress(event: PaymentEvent) { }
    })
}
```

