## Logging for Debugging

Enable detailed logs during development:

```kotlin
val config = TaplinkConfig(
    appId = "...",
    merchantId = "...",
    secretKey = "...",
    logEnabled = true,
    logLevel = LogLevel.DEBUG   // VERBOSE | DEBUG | INFO | WARN | ERROR
)
```

> **Disable logging in production** (`logEnabled = false`) to avoid leaking sensitive data.
